      "simplified": "“不是，我的妈妈是人。”饭饭说，“我的人妈妈叫我饭饭，她说这是我的名字。",
      "traditional": "“不是，我的媽媽是人。”飯飯說，“我的人媽媽叫我飯飯，她說這是我的名字。",
      "pinyin": "bú shì wǒ de mā ma shì rén fàn fàn shuō wǒ de rén mā ma jiào wǒ fàn fàn tā shuō zhè shì wǒ de míng zi",
      "english": "“No, my mom is human,” Fanfan said. “My human mom calls me Fanfan. She says that this is my name."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我的人妈妈很好。我们的家很大。”",
      "traditional": "我的人媽媽很好。我們的家很大。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de rén mā ma hěn hǎo wǒ men de jiā hěn dà",
      "english": "My human mom is great. Our home is very big.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
