    "sentence_translations": [
      "Fanfan’s Home",
      "",
      "“Your mom is not a cat? Who is she?” I asked Fanfan.",
      "",
      "“No, my mom is human,” Fanfan said. “My human mom calls me Fanfan. She says that this is my name.",
      "My human mom is great. Our home is very big.”",
      "",
      "“What is a home?”",
      "",
      "“A home is a good place,” Fanfan said. “You can eat, you can sleep, and you can play there.",
      "In my human mom’s home, I can eat a lot of things. Fruit and rice … everything is delicious.",
      "I can sleep. It’s not cold there, and not hot either. I can play. There are a lot of things to play with at home.”",
      "Fanfan smiled. He really liked his home.",
      ""
    ]
  }
